    "show_share": true,
    "description": "A new study has revealed that babies born to healthy mothers worldwide grow similarly in the womb and are of strikingly similar size at birth. Poor nutrition and health, not race or ethnicity, cause most of the current wide disparities in the size of babies born in different countries and to different populations.",
